  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BASE Program - Biobusiness Financing for a Sustainable Amazon in Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa BASE  Financiamiento de Bionegocios para un Amazonas Sostenible en el Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es fomentar la actividad productiva basada en la naturaleza para contribuir al desarrollo econmico e inclusivo sin causar degradacin ambiental en la Amazona Ecuatoriana. El objetivo especfico es aumentar el acceso a crdito y la inversin en bionegocios a travs de los mecanismos financieros de segundo piso de la Corporacin Nacional de Finanzas Populares y Solidarias (CONAFIPS).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to promote productive activity based on nature to contribute to economic and inclusive development without causing environmental degradation in the Ecuadorian Amazon. The specific objective is to increase access to credit and investment in biobusinesses through the second-tier financial mechanisms of the National Corporation for Popular and Solidarity Finance (CONAFIPS).</narrative>
  </description>
